# Interview Scheduling Agent — environment variables
#
# Calendar, video (Zoom/Meet), messaging (Slack), and email all connect via OAuth — no keys here.
# You only need a key if your ATS authenticates with one. The agent-onboarding skill will prompt you
# for whichever applies. Add it under Settings → Secrets (preferred) or copy this file to .env.

# --- ATS (pick the one you use, if it needs a key) ---
# GREENHOUSE_API_KEY=your-greenhouse-harvest-api-key
# ASHBY_API_KEY=your-ashby-api-key
# LEVER_API_KEY=your-lever-api-key

# --- Video (only if your video tool uses a key instead of OAuth) ---
# ZOOM_API_KEY=your-zoom-api-key
